\section*{RL versus L}

\subsection{OpenAI's claim}
OpenAI presents the following claims relevant to this question, with manuscript numbers following paper order in Sources. In manuscript 1 (family 103; 2026-09-23), the asserted result is that polynomial-time randomized logarithmic space can be simulated deterministically in logarithmic space, giving $\mathrm L=\mathrm{RL}=\mathrm{BPL}$.

\subsection{Outline of the argument}
For manuscript 1 (family 103; 2026-09-23), stochastic atoms are assembled with controlled numerical error and bounded suspended storage. Slice-mixing walks are generated without retaining their endpoints, and a fixed bounded-resource interpreter makes the deterministic simulation uniform over source machines.

\subsection{Scope relative to this problem}
The source claims equality of deterministic, one-sided randomized, and bounded-error randomized logarithmic space under its stated machine convention. This concerns the precise derandomization question, but complete coverage is not established by this catalogue and the status remains partial.

\subsection{Formal verification}
No Lean formalization is listed at this snapshot for manuscript 1 (family 103; 2026-09-23).

This site has not executed the Lean code. Described statement coverage is not an independent proof check.

\subsection{Status caveat}
The manuscripts were produced by an internal OpenAI model. OpenAI cautions that results without formalization can contain mistakes. This site has not independently checked the proofs; the label records the scope of OpenAI's claim.

\subsection{Sources}
\begin{itemize}
\item OpenAI, \emph{Exact derandomization of logarithmic space: L = RL = BPL}, 2026-09-23; citation key \texttt{OAI:Exact-Derandomization-of-Logarithmic-Space-L-equals-RL-equals-BPL-September-23-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Exact-Derandomization-of-Logarithmic-Space-L-equals-RL-equals-BPL-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Exact-Derandomization-of-Logarithmic-Space-L-equals-RL-equals-BPL-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Exact-Derandomization-of-Logarithmic-Space-L-equals-RL-equals-BPL-September-23-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Exact-Derandomization-of-Logarithmic-Space-L-equals-RL-equals-BPL-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{Latest version}.
